        "text": {
          "en": "Rajaraja Chola I ruled from 985 CE and built the Brihadisvara temple at Thanjavur. He strengthened the army and navy.\nHis son Rajendra Chola I sent the navy across the sea to Southeast Asia and built a new capital, Gangaikonda Cholapuram.\nThe Cholas had village assemblies and irrigation tanks, and traded widely overseas."
